1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,770
Everyone loves a holiday!
人人都爱假期！

2
00:00:02,770 --> 00:00:10,780
A little time off for some much-needed R & R can be exactly the thing to rejuvenate and refresh.
抽出一点时间来好好休息放松（R & R，即Rest and Relaxation），正是恢复活力、焕发精神的良方。

3
00:00:10,780 --> 00:00:17,730
That said, if you're struggling to think of your next destination then look no further.
话虽如此，如果你正纠结于下一个目的地，那就别再犹豫了。

4
00:00:17,730 --> 00:00:22,310
Don't waste time debating, let your blood decide.
不必浪费时间争论，让你的血脉来决定吧。

5
00:00:22,310 --> 00:00:25,720
Everybody has a lineage.
每个人都有自己的家族谱系。

6
00:00:25,720 --> 00:00:31,370
Recently, finding out more about our family origins has become popular.
近年来，探寻家族起源的风潮日渐盛行。

7
00:00:31,370 --> 00:00:43,830
By the start of 2019, 26 million people had taken an ancestry DNA test at home, according to a report by MIT Technology Review.
据《麻省理工科技评论》报道，截至2019年初，已有2600万人在家中进行了祖先DNA检测。

8
00:00:43,830 --> 00:00:51,225
They believe by 2021 this number will have risen to 100 million.
他们预计到2021年，这一数字将增至1亿。

9
00:00:51,225 --> 00:00:55,890
This trend has been noticed by opportunistic travel operators.
精明的旅游运营商已经注意到了这一趋势。

10
00:00:55,890 --> 00:01:10,280
Some are looking to provide a service that both allows people to trace their heritage - by literally going back to their roots - and travel to the destinations where their ancestors originated from.
一些运营商希望提供这样一种服务：既让人们能够追溯自己的家族传承——真正回到“根”之所在——又能前往祖先的发源地旅行。

11
00:01:10,280 --> 00:01:26,210
Airbnb, an online lodging marketplace, recently partnered with 23andMe, a DNA testing and analysis company, to offer recommendations that encourage travellers to walk in the footsteps of their forefathers.
在线住宿平台爱彼迎（Airbnb）最近与DNA检测分析公司23andMe合作，推出旅行推荐服务，鼓励旅行者追随祖先的足迹。

12
00:01:26,210 --> 00:01:29,495
And they aren't the only ones.
而这样做的并非只有他们一家。

13
00:01:29,495 --> 00:01:34,920
The Shelbourne hotel in Dublin has its own 'genealogy butler'.
都柏林的谢尔伯恩酒店（The Shelbourne）拥有专属的“谱系管家”。

14
00:01:34,920 --> 00:01:42,990
Hellen Kelly offers consultations to help guests trace their Irish line of descent using official records.
海伦·凯利提供咨询服务，帮助客人通过官方记录追溯自己的爱尔兰血统。

15
00:01:42,990 --> 00:01:50,290
This allows them to 'fill in the blanks of their Irish ancestry', she told Good Morning America.
她在接受《早安美国》采访时表示，这能让客人“填补爱尔兰家族谱系中的空白”。

16
00:01:50,290 --> 00:01:57,760
The Conte Club, a luxury travel company, offers custom itineraries based on DNA tests.
高端旅游公司孔特俱乐部（The Conte Club）提供基于DNA检测的定制旅行路线。

17
00:01:57,760 --> 00:02:09,110
'These experiences are about delving deeper into who we really are,' says Conte Club CEO Rebecca Fielding in an article in the Condé Nast Traveller.
孔特俱乐部首席执行官丽贝卡·菲尔丁在《悦游》杂志的一篇文章中表示：“这些旅行体验旨在让我们更深入地探索真实的自我。

18
00:02:09,110 --> 00:02:13,600
'It might be the most meaningful trip we can take.'
这可能是我们能进行的最有意义的旅行。”

19
00:02:13,600 --> 00:02:20,320
So next time you think of going on vacation, why not take a DNA test first?
所以，下次计划度假时，不妨先做一次DNA检测？

20
00:02:20,320 --> 00:02:26,660
Once you know how far your family has come, take the time to holiday back.
一旦你了解了家族的迁徙历程，就花点时间回到故土去度假吧。
